## 🎨 3️⃣ — `uppercase-box.component.css`

This CSS creates the “box” styling — completely separate from your TypeScript:

```css
.uppercase-box {
  border: 2px solid #6200ea;
  background-color: #f8f8f8;
  color: #333;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  font-size: 20px;
  width: 320px;
  margin: 40px auto;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  transition: 0.3s ease all;
}

.uppercase-box:hover {
  background-color: #ede7f6;
  color: #000;
}
```

✅ The `.uppercase-box` class gives a nice rounded box with a subtle shadow and hover effect.

